    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938263200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53035,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938267800000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Could I start with your name and the email address associated with your VeloFit account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938269800000
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Peterson. M-Peterson at webmail dot com.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53035,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938278533333
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. I'm pulling up your account now... Okay, I see your recent orders here. Could you tell me which item you're calling about?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938281733333
    },
    {
      "text": "The jersey.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53035,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938291199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Understood. And what specifically is the issue with the jersey? Is it a technical fault or a matter of preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938292133332
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong size. It's way too tight. I guess the sizing charts aren't for everyone.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53035,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938299933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that it didn't fit as expected. I'm looking at the order date here... I see it was delivered 68 days ago. Just one moment while I confirm our policy.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938305933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure. Take your time.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53035,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938317599998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for your patience, Mark. Great news. That jersey falls under our standard 90-day return policy, so you are well within the window. We can definitely process an exchange for a different size or a full refund for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938319199998
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh. So you can actually do something. Fine, an exchange would be best.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53035,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938334399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. I'm happy to help. I'll get that exchange started right away. I see you're one of our VIP members, so I've also gone ahead and waived the return shipping fee for you. You'll receive a pre-paid shipping label in your email within the next 15 minutes.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938339266664
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. Thanks, I guess.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53035,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768938356799997
    },
    {
